gold on its frontiers","where the old families still hold the real power","famous for its triumphs through the capital","whose provinces speak a hundred languages","ruled by an emperor who has never seen the frontier","which has had four emperors in a single year","which keeps an eagle in every legion","whose capital has a million people"],"holy":["ruled by a priest-king who claims to speak for the gods","whose cathedrals are taller than mountains","where every law is written in scripture","which sends crusading knights to every border","guarded by an order of holy knights","whose emperor is crowned by the high priestess","where the bells ring every hour of the day","which burns heretics and forgives no one","built around a temple older than the empire","ruled by a council of saints","whose pilgrims cross the world to see its shrines","where magic is allowed only to the clergy","whose holy relics are carried into battle","which believes it was chosen by heaven","whose capital is a city of a thousand temples","where the emperor fasts for the whole of winter","ruled by a child said to be a living saint","whose monks keep the oldest records in the world","which went to war over a stolen relic","where the faithful wear white on holy days","which keeps an eternal flame burning in every city","whose inquisitors are feared by kings","ruled from a cathedral-palace on a hill","which forbids the worship of any other god","whose holy texts are in a language no one speaks","famous for its choirs and stained glass","where the high priest outranks the emperor","whose knights take vows of silence","which sees itself as the last light in a dark world","built by pilgrims who never went home"],"eastern":["ruled from a palace with nine thousand rooms","whose emperor is called the Son of Heaven","famous for its silk, tea and porcelain","which has lasted for three hundred years","where scholars sit exams to serve the court","whose great wall runs along the northern border","ruled by a dynasty that came from the mountains","whose court poets are more famous than its generals","where the emperor is never seen by commoners","built along a great river and its canals","whose fleets of junks sail to distant lands","famous for its gardens and its tea houses","ruled by a council of eunuchs and ministers","whose capital is laid out like a star chart","where kites fill the sky at the spring festival","whose armies march behind silk banners","which keeps the calendar for all its neighbours","where every province sends tribute to the throne","ruled by an empress who seized the throne","whose emperors are buried with clay armies","which closed its ports to foreigners","famous for its lacquerware and paper lanterns","whose dynasty claims the mandate of heaven","where the emperor plants the first rice each spring","ruled from a city of red walls and golden roofs","whose temples sit on misty mountain tops","which has outlasted five rival kingdoms","where calligraphy is the highest art","whose generals write books on strategy","built on terraced hills of rice"],"horde":["which rides across the endless grasslands","founded by a great khan who united the clans","whose riders can shoot an arrow at full gallop","which moves its capital with the seasons","feared by every walled city in the world","ruled from a palace of felt tents","whose messengers cross the empire in days","where every warrior has three horses","which grew from a single clan to rule half the world","whose khan is chosen at a great gathering","which trades horses for silk and iron","where the khan's word is law from sea to sea","built on speed, archery and loyalty","whose sons divided the empire between them","which keeps the trade roads safe for merchants","where wrestling and archery decide honour","whose banners are made of horse hair","which taxes every caravan crossing the steppe","whose armies appear out of the dust without warning","ruled by a widow khatun for twenty years","which has never built a single city wall","whose people drink mare's milk at every feast","which welcomes every faith in its lands","whose eagle hunters are famous across the world","where the clans gather each summer for games","which sweeps down from the northern plains","whose great khan has never lost a battle","held together by oaths sworn over fire","ruled from the saddle","which stretches farther than any rider can travel in a year"],"dark":["ruled by an emperor who cannot die","whose armies are made of the risen dead","where the sun has not been seen in a century","built on the bones of the empire before it","whose emperor wears a crown of black iron","which has conquered every kingdom it has touched","where every citizen is watched","whose sorcerers rule beside the throne","which spreads a creeping fog across its borders","ruled from a tower of obsidian","whose name is spoken only in whispers","where rebellion is punished for seven generations","which made a pact with something below the earth","whose banners turn the sky grey","which harvests the magic of the lands it takes","whose dark lord has ruled for a thousand years","where the rivers run red with rust","whose legions march in total silence","which turned its own capital into a tomb","ruled by a council of masked lords","whose fortresses are carved from black glass","where the night lasts most of the year","which keeps captured kings in iron cages","whose emperor has not been seen in fifty years","which rose from a single cursed city","whose shadow stretches across three continents","where even the crows are spies","which has never once signed a peace treaty","ruled by a lich-emperor and his court","whose border towns are ghost towns"],"star":["spanning three hundred star systems","ruled from a throne world at the galactic core","whose fleets travel through folded space","governed by an artificial intelligence","which has waged war for a thousand years","whose emperor is a clone of the first emperor","built on a network of ancient jump gates","where every citizen is linked to a single mind","whose battleships are the size of moons","which mines dying stars for energy","ruled by a council of uploaded minds","whose colonies stretch across two spiral arms","which was founded by the crew of a lost generation ship","whose borders are guarded by a minefield of stars","where machines have replaced their makers","which terraforms every world it conquers","whose language is made of light pulses","ruled from a ring world around a blue giant","which has just made first contact with humanity","whose noble houses each rule a planet","built around a captured black hole","where the emperor speaks through a billion drones","which trades in starships and stolen technology","whose armies are bred in orbital vats","which buried its homeworld after a war","whose capital ship is also its capital city","where faster-than-light travel is a state secret","ruled by a hive mind of trillions","whose scientists have learned to move planets","which collapsed after its emperor vanished"]}}}